#==============================================================================================
#
#   font_style_style_value - FontStyleStyleValue: normal, italic, oblique and oblique <angle>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/FontStyleStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-72) and the inline
#       members of FontStyleStyleValue.h. to_font_slope's function-local statics cache
#       Gfx::name_to_slope of constant names; the port calls name_to_slope, which gives the same
#       answer each time.
